# Tune panel (F12) smoke: toggle rows + linear pass builder.
# Geometry locked by test_tune_panel.h::test_script_geometry_lock (panel rect,
# log/view/pic toggle rows, bottom-anchored build row).
#   log toggle       (273,31)
#   view enhance     (273,42)   cycles 6x (s2>s3) <-> nearest, applies
#   pic enhance      (273,53)   cycles the available pass modes, applies
#   build row @ y=177: +f (236)  +l (249)  +a (262)  clear (280)  add (304)
# The three toggle rows flow straight from the title row (no variable rows
# above them) and the build row is bottom-anchored, so every click here is
# stable regardless of how many view-scaler / pass modes are registered.
wait 4500
snap tune-baseline
key f12
wait 500
snap tune-open
# view enhance -> nearest (blocky A/B "before"), then back to 6x.
click 273 42
wait 1500
snap tune-view-nearest
click 273 42
wait 1500
snap tune-view-6x
# pic enhance: cycle to the next known pass mode (regen in memory; settle time).
click 273 53
wait 5000
snap tune-pic-cycled
# Build a custom sequence with +f/+a, then Add it (registers + applies).
click 236 177
wait 300
click 262 177
wait 300
snap tune-built
click 304 177
wait 5000
snap tune-added
# clear empties the built sequence.
click 280 177
wait 300
snap tune-cleared
key f12
wait 500
snap tune-closed
quit
